        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "This is your shop.\n\nYou can change your offer by adding or removing items to/from the shop inventory. A maximum of 20 items can be placed permanently in it. If another player buys an item from your shop, the payment is credited to your bank account. Items are sold at 90% of the item value. Remember to check the inventory frequently or other players may take over your shop.",
